{"id":72108,"date":"2026-10-31T21:09:49","date_gmt":"2026-10-31T21:09:49","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=72108"},"modified":"2026-10-31T22:12:25","modified_gmt":"2026-10-31T21:12:25","slug":"sao-silvestre-idanha-a-nova","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/sao-silvestre-idanha-a-nova\/","title":{"rendered":"S\u00e3o Silvestre Idanha-a-Nova 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">S\u00e3o Silvestre Idanha-a-Nova 2026<\/span><\/h2><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong>S\u00e3o Silvestre de Idanha-a-Nova 2026<\/strong> (11\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o) realiza-se no dia <strong>5 de Dezembro de 2026<\/strong> (S\u00e1bado), iluminando as art\u00e9rias de <strong>Idanha-a-Nova<\/strong>, no distrito de <strong>Castelo Branco<\/strong>. Com epicentro de partida e chegada instalado em frente \u00e0 <strong>ESGIN (Escola Superior de Gest\u00e3o de Idanha-a-Nova)<\/strong>, o evento arranca \u00e0s <strong>18:00<\/strong> com os escal\u00f5es jovens da <strong>S\u00e3o Silvestre da Pequenada<\/strong> e culmina \u00e0s <strong>19:00<\/strong> com o tiro de partida para a prova rainha de <strong>10 km<\/strong> e para a caminhada de <strong>5 km<\/strong>.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Em plena regi\u00e3o hist\u00f3rica da Beira Baixa e no territ\u00f3rio do Geopark Naturtejo e da Cidade Criativa da M\u00fasica da UNESCO, vais encontrar um novo tra\u00e7ado urbano r\u00e1pido e festivo. O programa integra a <strong>Corrida Principal de 10 km<\/strong> (destinada a juniores, seniores e veteranos, com cronometragem por chip e Meta Volante Alberto Chai\u00e7a), a <strong>Caminhada \/ Corrida N\u00e3o Competitiva de 5 km<\/strong> e quatro provas dedicadas aos mais novos: <strong>Benjamins (700 m)<\/strong>, <strong>Infantis (2 km)<\/strong>, <strong>Iniciados (3,5 km)<\/strong> e <strong>Juvenis (5 km)<\/strong>.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Organizada pelo hist\u00f3rico <strong>Club Uni\u00e3o Idanhense<\/strong>, em parceria com a <strong>C\u00e2mara Municipal de Idanha-a-Nova<\/strong>, a <strong>Uni\u00e3o de Freguesias de Idanha-a-Nova e Alcafozes<\/strong> e o ajuizamento t\u00e9cnico da <strong>Associa\u00e7\u00e3o de Atletismo de Castelo Branco<\/strong>, a prova distingue-se pelo conv\u00edvio p\u00f3s-meta na <strong>Tenda da Feira Raiana<\/strong>, onde todos os participantes t\u00eam direito a jersey\/t-shirt, medalha finisher met\u00e1lica e \u00e0 tradicional <strong>Sopa da Matan\u00e7a<\/strong>, al\u00e9m de pr\u00e9mios monet\u00e1rios para o Top 10 absoluto e para as tr\u00eas melhores equipas. Esta prova integra o calend\u00e1rio oficial das <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/corridas-sao-silvestre\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Corridas de S\u00e3o Silvestre em Portugal<\/a>.<\/p><\/div><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2><ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\"><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">5 de Dezembro de 2026<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho & Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">ESGIN (Escola Superior de Gest\u00e3o), Idanha-a-Nova, Castelo Branco<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(2