0;\">2\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 10.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (14 Nov a 29 Nov 2026)<\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\"><div style=\"flex: 1; min-width: 200px;\"><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Corrida Kids<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">S\u00e3o Silvestre da Pequenada \u2013 Benjamins (700 m)<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 5 de Dezembro de 2026 \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 18:00<\/span><\/div><div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\"><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Inscri\u00e7\u00e3o Gratuita:<\/strong> 0.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 29 Nov 2026)<\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/ul><\/div><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando e a que horas se realiza a S\u00e3o Silvestre de Idanha-a-Nova 2026?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A 11\u00aa S\u00e3o Silvestre de Idanha-a-Nova realiza-se no s\u00e1bado, 5 de dezembro de 2026, com partida e chegada em frente \u00e0 ESGIN (Escola Superior de Gest\u00e3o de Idanha-a-Nova). As provas da S\u00e3o Silvestre da Pequenada arrancam \u00e0s 18:00 (Benjamins 700 m), 18:10 (Infantis 2 km), 18:30 (Iniciados 3,5 km) e 18:55 (Juvenis 5 km), enquanto a Corrida Principal de 10 km e a Caminhada de 5 km partem \u00e0s 19:00.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os pre\u00e7os e prazos de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o na S\u00e3o Silvestre de Idanha-a-Nova 2026?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es decorrem at\u00e9 \u00e0s 23:59 do dia 29 de novembro de 2026, divididas em duas fases: na 1\u00aa fase (6 de outubro a 14 de novembro), a Corrida 10 km custa 12\u20ac e os escal\u00f5es Infantis\/Iniciados\/Juvenis custam 7\u20ac; na 2\u00aa fase (14 a 30 de novembro), a Corrida 10 km passa a 15\u20ac e os escal\u00f5es jovens a 10\u20ac. A Caminhada de 5 km tem o valor \u00fanico de 10\u20ac e o escal\u00e3o Benjamins (at\u00e9 11 anos) \u00e9 gratuito.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde funciona o secretariado para levantamento de dorsais e onde s\u00e3o os banhos?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O secretariado da prova funciona no Recinto da Feira Raiana no pr\u00f3prio dia do evento (s\u00e1bado, 5 de dezembro de 2026), entre as 14:00 e as 18:00. Os banhos para os atletas est\u00e3o dispon\u00edveis no Pavilh\u00e3o Municipal de Idanha-a-Nova e a entrega de pr\u00e9mios decorre \u00e0s 20:30 na Tenda da Feira Raiana.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">O que inclui o kit de atleta da S\u00e3o Silvestre de Idanha-a-Nova 2026?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Na Corrida de 10 km, o kit de atleta inclui jersey t\u00e9cnico, medalha finisher met\u00e1lica, dorsal personalizado com chip, seguro desportivo e a tradicional Sopa da Matan\u00e7a com bebida no final. Na Caminhada de 5 km, o kit inclui t-shirt alusiva, dorsal personalizado, Sopa da Matan\u00e7a e bebida.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Existem pr\u00e9mios monet\u00e1rios e coletivos na S\u00e3o Silvestre de Idanha-a-Nova?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Sim, a organiza\u00e7\u00e3o do Club Uni\u00e3o Idanhense atribui pr\u00e9mios monet\u00e1rios aos 10 primeiros classificados absolutos masculinos e femininos (300\u20ac ao 1\u00ba, 200\u20ac ao 2\u00ba, 100\u20ac ao 3\u00ba, 80\u20ac ao 4\u00ba, 60\u20ac ao 5\u00ba e 50\u20ac do 6\u00ba ao 10\u00ba), \u00e0s 3 melhores equipas masculinas e femininas (200\u20ac, 150\u20ac e 100\u20ac), 100\u20ac aos melhores atletas do concelho (M\/F) e 100\u20ac na Meta Volante Alberto Chai\u00e7a (M\/F).<\/div><\/details><\/div><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"S\u00e3o Silvestre Idanha-a-Nova 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-12-05\", \"endDate\": \"2026-12-05\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"ESGIN (Escola Superior de Gest\u00e3o), Idanha-a-Nova\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Idanha-a-Nova\", \"addressRegion\": \"Castelo Branco\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"description\": \"A S\u00e3o Silvestre de Idanha-a-Nova 2026 corre-se a 5 de dezembro \u00e0s 19h00: corrida 10 km, caminhada 5 km e Pequenada. Consulta o regulamento e inscreve-te!\", \"image\": [\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/cartaz-sao-silvestre-idanha-a-nova.webp\"], \"offers\": [{\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"Corrida S\u00e3o Silvestre 10 km (Juniores, Seniores e Veteranos)\", \"price\": \"12.00\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/waitastart.com\/sao-silvestre-idanha-a-nova-2026\/\"}, {\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"Caminhada \/ Corrida N\u00e3o Competitiva 5 km\", \"price\": \"10.00\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/waitastart.com\/sao-silvestre-idanha-a-nova-2026\/\"}, {